      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm helping out with our neighborhood newsletter and we're doing a section on the new zoning proposals the city council is talking about. can you give me a quick summary of the two main sides of the debate? like one side that wants more high-density housing and the side that wants to keep the single-family neighborhoods as they are. just need a good overview of what people are arguing for. thanks!",
